@@text Results 2026-10-27 night (overall run, perf.md 12): SQ-PERFCFG-01 PASS (ModernFix patch list, its own "Static binding violation" WARNs only; it carried `cache_strongholds`, which pre-empted the pack's ring cache: now off in `config/modernfix-mixins.properties`). SQ-PERFCFG-02: values kept PASS; idle 5.7-6.0 ms against 5.5 ms not met on the number, the JFR puts the extra on mob ticking of an aged world (pack and DH costs fell, p95 41 -> 6.5 ms). SQ-PERFCFG-03 not run (owner 2026-10-27: overall measurement only, no per-change worlds).
